{"id":"508219e8b4c7dadf","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-analysis-omega-theory.md","title":"Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","display":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory","aliases":["89-df-analysis-omega-theory"],"display":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure","depends_on":["[[89-df-omega-rule]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-analysis-language]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-analysis-omega-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-analysis-omega-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-analysis-omega-theory — Analysis and Its Omega-Rule Closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b\" href=\"?note=e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b\" title=\"89-df-omega-rule\">89-df-omega-rule</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a257e5b1de6880b7\" href=\"?note=a257e5b1de6880b7\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-language\">89-df-arithmetical-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\mathsf V_s,\\mathrm{ucl}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\mathsf V_s,\\mathrm{ucl}_2\\)</span> 及保类型替换来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ab645f955c77848\" href=\"?note=8ab645f955c77848\" title=\"89-df-analysis-language\">89-df-analysis-language</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_0=\\mathrm{Tm}_2\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_0=\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Term}_{k+1}=\\mathsf V_{k+1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Term}_{k+1}=\\mathsf V_{k+1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\">\\(\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})\\)</span> 是互异数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 在本语言上取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_2\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>逻辑为下面给出的可枚举多类一阶演算；没有将标准满二阶有效式全体当作公理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Log}_2\">\\(\\mathsf{Log}_2\\)</span> 表示其逻辑公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_2\">\\(\\mathcal R_2\\)</span> 是有限前提规则关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_2&amp;\\coloneqq F^2_0\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\mid z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_2),\\quad v_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad\nv_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Log}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]\\mid s\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ind}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X(0)\\land\\forall x(X(x)\\to X(Sx)))\\to\\forall xX(x))\\mid X\\in\\mathsf V_2^{(1)},x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf V_2^{(1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(1)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cmp}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{k-1}(X(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow A))\\mid\nk\\in\\omega,X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1},\\vec x\\in\\mathsf V_0^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec x),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Log}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Ind}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Cmp}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\neg(0=Sx),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y)\\mid x,y\\in\\mathsf V_0,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal R_2=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_2&amp;\\coloneqq F^2_0\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\mid z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_2),\\quad v_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad\nv_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Log}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]\\mid s\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{t=t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ind}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X(0)\\land\\forall x(X(x)\\to X(Sx)))\\to\\forall xX(x))\\mid X\\in\\mathsf V_2^{(1)},x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf V_2^{(1)}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(1)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cmp}_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{k-1}(X(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow A))\\mid\nk\\in\\omega,X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1},\\vec x\\in\\mathsf V_0^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec x),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Log}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Ind}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Cmp}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\neg(0=Sx),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y)\\mid x,y\\in\\mathsf V_0,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_2&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal R_2=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 14 章，印刷页 177–179；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n先在全部公式集上对固定演算闭合，再取闭句部分，避免把开放逻辑公理要求为闭句集的成员。模式集可枚举，普通可证性与完整 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 可证性的复杂度不同。原书证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{An}\">\\(\\mathrm{An}\\)</span> 可定义加法、乘法并包含 PA；本条没有把完整二阶有效性（不可有效公理化）误当作该可枚举公理理论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-omega-rule","status":"resolved","id":"e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-language","status":"resolved","id":"a257e5b1de6880b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-analysis-language","status":"resolved","id":"8ab645f955c77848","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\mathsf V_s,\\mathrm{ucl}_2$ 及保类型替换来自 [[89-df-analysis-language]]。$\\mathsf{Term}_0=\\mathrm{Tm}_2$，$\\mathsf{Term}_{k+1}=\\mathsf V_{k+1}$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\mathrm{Tm}_2,\\mathsf V_s,\\mathrm{ucl}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_0=\\mathrm{Tm}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Term}_{k+1}=\\mathsf V_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=(x_0,\\ldots,x_{k-1})","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Log}_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}analysis\\text{-}omega\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_2&\\coloneqq F^2_0\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\mid z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_2),\\quad v_e(\\neg A)\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad\nv_e(A\\lor B)\\coloneqq\\max(v_e(A),v_e(B)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Taut}_2&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Log}_2&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Taut}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall zA\\to A[z:=t]\\mid s\\in\\omega,z\\in\\mathsf V_s,t\\in\\mathsf{Term}_s,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{\\forall z(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall zB)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\setminus\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{t=t\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u])\\mid t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_2,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ind}_2&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2((X(0)\\land\\forall x(X(x)\\to X(Sx)))\\to\\forall xX(x))\\mid X\\in\\mathsf V_2^{(1)},x\\in\\mathsf V_0\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf V_2^{(1)}&\\coloneqq\\{X_i^{(1)}\\mid i\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Cmp}_2&\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{ucl}_2(\\exists X\\forall x_0\\cdots\\forall x_{k-1}(X(\\vec x)\\leftrightarrow A))\\mid\nk\\in\\omega,X\\in\\mathsf V_{k+1},\\vec x\\in\\mathsf V_0^k,\\operatorname{Inj}(\\vec x),A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,X\\notin\\mathrm{FV}_2(A)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Log}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Ind}_2\\cup\\mathsf{Cmp}_2\n\\cup\\{\\forall x\\neg(0=Sx),\\ \\forall x\\forall y(Sx=Sy\\to x=y)\\mid x,y\\in\\mathsf V_0,x\\ne y\\},\\\\\n\\mathcal R_2&\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\}\n\\cup\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2,\\\\\n\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An}_\\omega)&\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\mid\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathrm{An}}\\subseteq X,\\\n\\forall(\\Gamma,B)\\in\\mathcal R_2\\cup\\mathcal R_\\omega^{\\mathrm{An}}\\ (\\Gamma\\subseteq X\\to B\\in X)\\}\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_2\\\\\n\\mathrm{MP}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A,A\\to B\\},B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Gen}&\\coloneqq\\{(\\{A\\},\\forall zA)\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_2,\\ z\\in\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}\\},\\quad\n\\mathcal R_2=\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{An}","display":false}],"bytes":3872,"backlinks":[{"id":"d0116d2c9f5af20f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"所有语法、编码、公理和规则取 [[89-df-analysis-language]]、[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]。$\\operatorname{dec}_2$ 是 $g_2$ 在项/公式码像上的逆，其余输入返回固定失败标记 $\\star_2$；$\\operatorname{var}_2=\\mathsf{ind}^{-1}:\\omega\\to\\mathsf V_{\\mathrm{all}}$。"},{"id":"43a8d98c9b5fc94d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"571457cbee377421","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb08f01f5311762f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}$ 取既有双模态定理集；$\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathrm{An})$ 是 [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] 定义的普通分析闭句定理集。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-rule]] → [[89-df-analysis-omega-theory]] → [[89-thm-analysis-omega-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["e8a3a16d1e5a3f9b","a257e5b1de6880b7","2e7227755a8473e0","8ab645f955c77848"]}